ut  brady was just too much anyway  after the game as the raiders fall to  three and three john gruden talked about  this disappointing loss  really proud of our football team we  have to play better  obviously on defense we're we got better  players we got to play better we will  disappointing credit to tampa bay  they're a good football team  and i think we are too but i'll answer  any questions i can  um the decision to keep the field goal  [Music]  well yeah so excuse me it was a long one  we had it more like two and it was a  24-20 game  at that time with the field goal and we  felt  at home a little momentum we could hold  tampa to at least  a field goal or possibly get off the  field we had them third and twelve  uh unfortunately we had them right where  we wanted them  and they converted on a check down very  disappointed but uh  it's easy to second guess right now but  in hindsight it probably would have done  the same thing  hey john did you see what happened on  the play where jack jackson was ejected  and i guess just in that moment how  important is it  i did not see what he did i was asking  the officials exactly and  i'll have to get there you'll have to  get their interpretation i i believe the  ejection came from new york city  uh they had access to replays perhaps we  didn't  um but losing sam young early in the  game and then losing gabe  with the week that we have had against a  heck of a defense is  is it was tough on us no doubt  john you've always said your defense is  great effort uh when it comes to certain  plays the effort is there but  do you think the town's always there do  they just have to get better as players  well we got to do a better job it goes  back to me uh  obviously missing abram and arnett in  the back end is tough on us  but i'm not making any excuses we did  not get enough pass rush today and if  you don't let if you let tom brady stand  back there and survey the field he's  proven for 20 years  uh and he proved it for 21