se i think in the entire world  that would throw a party  for a fan it is actually super fan  gorilla birthday here today and that's  what everyone is celebrating a little  bit ago we saw him cut the cake  you know shake hands hug he's actually  taking photographs now  with fans deontay tell me is there any  other fan base that would do this and  throw a birthday party for a super  fan man last time i checked i don't see  any fan that's going to  be like the raider fans right now like i  mean we're the most passionate we're the  most die-hard  and i'll challenge any fan to say that  that we're not  you know because every year is our year  you know every year we're going to the  super bowl every year that's our  mentality  it's a red i mean silver and black and  that's why i believe  every day you know and everybody that's  here today  oh my god you should see how  awesome well thank you so much deontay  as i mentioned it's gorilla  birthday coming up at five we will talk  to the birthday boy  of course for now reporting live at the  west gate kennedy martin 8 sports now  where's the disco ball that place looked  amazing right  even in defeat the raider nation goes  all out

